        "created_at": "2016-02-03T19:26:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm sure that this is news to no one but me (especially because it's&nbsp;<strong>literally written on her cards</strong>), but I hadn't realized that if you can give Unity an off-turn card play (through Argent Adept or any other means), she can play her Mechanical Golems!</p><p>Handy little interaction - suddenly giving Unity a card play outside of her turn is&nbsp;<em>super good</em>.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:26.189Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
